rlm-glogin [-f|--force]

Ensure valid gcloud Application Default Credentials (ADC) are in place.
Checks whether the stored ADC can still mint an access token; if they
are missing, expired, or revoked, it runs an interactive
`gcloud auth login --enable-gdrive-access --update-adc` so the new
credentials also carry the Google Drive scope (needed for federated
BigQuery external tables backed by Drive). When ADC are still valid the
function prints a notice and exits without prompting.

ARGUMENTS
  -f, --force   Skip the validity check and re-authenticate unconditionally.
  -h, --help    Show this help.

REQUIRES
  gcloud
